  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Women and Girls Health: The Ending Preventable Deaths of Mothers, Babies and Children support programme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This programme provides technical assistance (TA) to FCDO teams to complement all UK investments that support the manifesto commitment to End the Preventable Deaths of mothers, babies and children by 2030 (EPD).  The FCDO EPD approach paper (2021) is central to women and girls&#x2019; health, encompassing aspects of policy and programme work in health systems, sexual reproductive health and rights, nutrition, water, sanitation and hygiene, climate resilient health and research.</narrative>
  </description>
